Ambassador's approval rating

787
01:07:55.259 --> 01:07:57.552
is rising noticeably

788
01:07:57.553 --> 01:07:59.596
Candidate registration for presidential election next week...

789
01:08:00.389 --> 01:08:01.557
Until next week

790
01:08:02.766 --> 01:08:05.102
You can run for office without a political party affiliation.

791
01:08:05.728 --> 01:08:07.771
Miji, Changhee

792
01:08:08.522 --> 01:08:09.857
I'm not qualified

793
01:08:10.524 --> 01:08:12.150
The reason I ran for office in the first place

794
01:08:12.151 --> 01:08:14.361
Not because I deserve to be president

795
01:08:15.070 --> 01:08:17.614
Why my husband died
Because I want to reveal it.

796
01:08:18.907 --> 01:08:20.534
But, Ambassador.

797
01:08:21.160 --> 01:08:23.412
Oh, me

798
01:08:24.246 --> 01:08:28.125
There is a more qualified candidate than the ambassador.
I don't think there is

799
01:08:28.751 --> 01:08:30.543
So just give me a signal anytime.

800
01:08:30.544 --> 01:08:33.087
I'll cancel my flight to the US right away.

801
01:08:33.088 --> 01:08:35.966
From the beginning I
I left my schedule empty.

802
01:08:36.592 --> 01:08:37.925
uncle

803
01:08:37.926 --> 01:08:39.928
Giggles, kinda

804
01:08:40.596 --> 01:08:42.138
You are my ambassador.

805
01:08:42.139 --> 01:08:43.639
Are you my ambassador?

806
01:08:56.278 --> 01:08:57.403
yes

807
01:08:57.404 --> 01:08:59.365
me soon
Depart for Beijing

808
01:09:02.242 --> 01:09:03.077
Mr. President

809
01:09:03.827 --> 01:09:05.661
I thought a lot last night

810
01:09:07.373 --> 01:09:10.291
Days from now, months from now

811
01:09:10.292 --> 01:09:14.337
And the next few years
How important is it to the fate of the Korean Peninsula?

812
01:09:14.338 --> 01:09:16.798
And my term is over

813
01:09:16.799 --> 01:09:19.426
The role of the next leader
How enormous is it?

814
01:09:22.262 --> 01:09:24.098
I think it should be you

815
01:09:25.766 --> 01:09:27.725
Understand the challenges of the times

816
01:09:27.726 --> 01:09:29.561
someone who can handle it

817
01:09:31.647 --> 01:09:33.856
I went to Beijing and left the party.

818
01:09:33.857 --> 01:09:37.027
How to give you strength
I wonder what it would be like to find it

819
01:09:38.612 --> 01:09:40.072
I don't think I can do it

820
01:09:41.573 --> 01:09:42.408
Why?

821
01:09:48.705 --> 01:09:49.790
I still...

822
01:09:55.754 --> 01:09:56.755
I'm so sad

823
01:10:02.594 --> 01:10:04.179
I wish I had a president like that

824
01:10:05.055 --> 01:10:06.473
person who has suffered a lot

825
01:10:08.100 --> 01:10:10.436
That pain
A person who has the power to break through

826
01:10:11.270 --> 01:10:12.771
That's why I became stronger

827
01:10:13.313 --> 01:10:15.315
Even though he was the candidate of the opposing party

828
01:10:15.899 --> 01:10:19.236
While I support you
It could give a message of unity.

829
01:10:20.904 --> 01:10:23.407
Unification of the Korean Peninsula
If you are a leader who has made it your mission

830
01:10:24.199 --> 01:10:26.076
We need to achieve this level of integration.

831
01:10:27.077 --> 01:10:28.328
think about it carefully

832
01:10:29.246 --> 01:10:31.290
It's not your personal point of view.

833
01:10:32.207 --> 01:10:33.958
From a historical perspective

834
01:10:50.934 --> 01:10:52.186
I had a dream

835
01:10:53.479 --> 01:10:54.646
I was a woman

836
01:10:57.566 --> 01:10:59.443
I didn't believe in God

837
01:11:00.527 --> 01:11:02.905
There was a church in my heart

838
01:11:03.781 --> 01:11:06.575
I will build a pillar from my father's bones

839
01:11:07.493 --> 01:11:09.578
Covering the walls with mother's flesh

840
01:11:11.288 --> 01:11:13.290
Washing the floor with my husband's blood

841
01:11:15.167 --> 01:11:18.629
The soul of a tiny baby
A place sent up to the sky

842
01:11:20.923 --> 01:11:22.632
Before I came here I

843
01:11:22.633 --> 01:11:25.968
digging the ground on a black hill
buried my love

844
01:11:25.969 --> 01:11:27.429
and prayed

845
01:11:28.847 --> 01:11:30.598
take my peace

846
01:11:30.599 --> 01:11:32.684
Please bring peace to this land

847
01:11:33.727 --> 01:11:36.729
So there is enough peace for everyone

848
01:11:36.730 --> 01:11:39.106
When we no longer need peace

849
01:11:39.107 --> 01:11:41.819
My poor love
give it back to me

850
01:11:43.278 --> 01:11:44.613
I don't believe in the Lord

851
01:11:45.239 --> 01:11:48.616
Forgiveness of sins and resurrection of the body

852
01:11:48.617 --> 01:11:50.619
I don't believe in eternal life

853
01:11:52.204 --> 01:11:54.957
That person is inside me
I know I'll stay forever

854
01:13:09.698 --> 01:13:11.199
above my north star

855
01:14:04.419 --> 01:14:05.587
hello

856
01:14:07.005 --> 01:14:10.425
My name is Seo Moon-ju.

857
01:14:14.096 --> 01:14:15.097
I am today

858
01:14:16.139 --> 01:14:20.185
22nd President of the Republic of Korea
To declare candidacy for election

859
01:14:20.894 --> 01:14:22.312
I'm standing here

